{
  "name": "suite-330",
  "note": "The full suite at the interruptible-commitment count (333/backend), 12-way slices: the 10-way arms died unbanked when this slice's multi-day scenarios fattened slice heaps (js-0..3, js-6 and wasm-6 lost at 10-way). Same resources; fewer worlds per heap.",
